    "show_share": true,
    "description": "The Aga Khan University Graduate School of Media and Communications (GSMC) students and alumni were awarded at Media Council of Kenya's Annual Journalism Excellence Awards (AJEA) 2023. The awards which were held at Safari Park Hotel on May 4 th  2023 saw journalists from TV, print and radio feted for the different works they have done.",
